       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-TF-ZORSE-PROVING-STRATEGY.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-TENSORFLOW-OPERATIONAL-MAP.
           05  WS-TF-GRAPH-STATIC-FLOW     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ZORSE-2D-BESSEL-ENVELOPE PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SWIGLU-GATING-7-8THS     PIC 9(03)V9(03) VALUE 000.875.
           05  WS-REBAR-SHADOW-RESTITUTION PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-MOTZKIN-PRIME-GALOIS     PIC 9(15) VALUE 953467954114363.
       01  WS-TF-ZORSE-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-DYNAMIC-GRAPH-DECIDABLE  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-TF-ZORSE-CODE      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-MAP-STATIC-GRAPH-TO-ZORSE.
           PERFORM 2000-ASSERT-BESSEL-ATTENTION.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-TF-ZORSE-PROVING.
           GOBACK.
       1000-MAP-STATIC-GRAPH-TO-ZORSE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TF-GRAPH-STATIC-FLOW.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ZORSE-2D-BESSEL-ENVELOPE.
       2000-ASSERT-BESSEL-ATTENTION.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-REBAR-SHADOW-RESTITUTION.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-TF-ZORSE-PROVING.
           IF WS-TF-GRAPH-STATIC-FLOW = 1 AND
              WS-ZORSE-2D-BESSEL-ENVELOPE = 1 AND
              WS-SWIGLU-GATING-7-8THS >= 000.875 AND
              WS-REBAR-SHADOW-RESTITUTION = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-DYNAMIC-GRAPH-DECIDABLE
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-TF-ZORSE-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-DYNAMIC-GRAPH-DECIDABLE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-TF-ZORSE-CODE.
